{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1787.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"ca73d9ec023a4106f02f53c065a6a6fe2912954813f60cf3335a85b19c86d62a","ja":"可奈のお世話","zh":"照顾可奈","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1787.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"547df4714b2138426f57808bad5d7d760a6e3a2961e4937987ad8944dc578813","ja":"可奈たちは、劇場裏手のスペースを借りて\nカリフラワーを育てることになって……","zh":"可奈她们借用了剧场后面的空地，决定在那里种花椰菜……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1787.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"aa076d04a80b0b86ac37d377b03d37d19e88109b720d308f8ffaa2f65e84e773","ja":"（あれ？　防虫ネットって、水やりのときは\n外すんだっけ？　えっと……一応外しておこうかな？）","zh":"（咦？防虫网浇水的时候，是要取下来的吗？那个……总之还是先取下来吧？）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1787.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"e844c6e49de02ca603d5ee2bdb7836b384727ddc045b879685b549143149d49f","ja":"お水たっぷり～♪　愛情もたっぷり～♪\n可奈たちのカリフラワー♪　おいしくなるかな～♪","zh":"水加得足足的～♪　爱心也满满的～♪\n可奈她们的菜花♪　会变得好吃吗～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1787.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481","ja":"翌日……","zh":"隔天……","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1787.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"0a88305fe4af1b83af993fdc44083faa98f41ddc3f9736f0d39c1fd435fa4d48","ja":"お仕事お疲れさまでした～……あっ！\n昨日、お水をあげて、防虫ネット戻すの忘れてた～！！","zh":"工作辛苦了～……啊！\n昨天浇完水，忘记把防虫网放回去了～！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1787.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"82e757cae2207263ba1f6a8317b6b84db54103b9994bf13824dc74dd790a0022","ja":"ど、どうしよう～……。\n虫に食べられちゃったり、してないかな～……。","zh":"怎、怎么办啊～……  \n不会已经被虫子吃掉了吧～……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1787.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"1dc3c729237463c00f38af7ad382a8acb2ad3ffa218f0ac351357f8812541ec6","ja":"あら？　わたくしが今朝、\nお水をあげた時には、かかってましたわよ？","zh":"哎呀？我今天早上浇水的时候，明明还挂着呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1787.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"23886ebe833a0d54f75cc8270a8af3b114ea97c9ad3091ff6883a99cefc2b17e","ja":"それなら、あたしがつけておいたよぉ。\nあと、水やりはネットをつけたままでいいからねぇ。","zh":"那样的话，我已经帮你系好了哦。\n还有，浇水时保持网罩套着就行啦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1787.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"f05c17d9486ac437a1bce5a0bca83e13af8351b3bad2935d13819689e0e65dc8","ja":"わ～ん、ありがとう！\nはぁ～、私ももっとちゃんとしなきゃ……。","zh":"呜～谢谢你！\n唉～我也得更加认真才行……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1787.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"7deb50e2bc0813db423a94cc0c64b2e15286dab44b3221a33aaae199416e0633","ja":"よーし！　今度こそ！　劇場に戻って、\nカリフラワーの様子をみてきま～す！","zh":"好！这次一定要成功！回剧场去看看花椰菜的情况～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1787.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"61f29069b7f1d4ffb125b82b5c95add1bdc2534f4c8722132d820a720d23c065","ja":"お疲れ様でした～！","zh":"辛苦了～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1787.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"a84aa17c0e1c2cf5526f490cf23a9a4ccc476f73f9d9b25435255366e9316f10","ja":"わたくしも一緒に……って、すごい\n早着替えでしたわね。追いつけそうにありませんわ。","zh":"我也一起……哇，您换装的速度真快啊。我好像追不上您了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1787.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"0becc081a08026dd9b81cec67f761abe6be0db45c516a5f0fd2e8bfc0a47ba05","ja":"可奈ちゃん、お世話頑張っててえらいねぇ♪","zh":"可奈，你努力照顾得这么用心，真棒呀♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
